## Notices

You must ensure that everyone who gets a copy of any part of the software from
you, with or without changes, also gets the text of this license or a link to
<https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0/>.

## Excuse

If anyone notifies you in writing that you have not complied with this license,
you can keep your license by taking all practical steps to comply within 32
days after the notice.  If you do not do so, your license ends immediately.

## Patent License

The licensor grants you a patent license for the software that covers patent
